---
import { joinCommunityUrl } from "@/lib/navigation";
---

<section class="site-section bg-muted">
	<div class="site-container">
		<div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[0.95fr_1.05fr] lg:items-start">
			<div class="max-w-2xl">
				<p class="eyebrow">About the community</p>
				<h2 class="mt-4">
					A local space for people building with AWS.
				</h2>
				<p class="lead mt-6">
					AWS User Group Bandung brings developers, students, operators,
					architects, founders, and cloud-curious builders into the same
					conversation, so AWS knowledge does not stay locked inside one
					company, team, or job title.
				</p>
				<p class="mt-5">
					Expect practical talks, honest questions, local connections, and
					space to share what you are learning, whether you are deploying
					your first workload or running production systems.
				</p>

				<a
					href={joinCommunityUrl}
					target="_blank"
					rel="noopener noreferrer"
					class="button-secondary mt-8 bg-background"
				>
					Join the local group
				</a>
			</div>

			<aside class="aws-card overflow-hidden bg-background" aria-label="Community snapshot">
				<div class="h-2 bg-primary"></div>
				<div class="p-6 sm:p-8">
					<div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-6 border-b border-border pb-6">
						<div>
							<p class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-muted-foreground">
								What it is for
							</p>
							<h2 class="mt-4 text-3xl leading-tight">
								Make cloud learning local.
							</h2>
						</div>
						<img src="/images/awsug-bandung-logo.png" alt="" class="h-12 w-12 shrink-0" />
					</div>

					<div class="mt-2 divide-y divide-border">
						<div class="grid gap-3 py-6 sm:grid-cols-[8.5rem_1fr]">
							<p class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-primary">
								Ask
							</p>
							<div>
								<h3 class="text-base">Bring the part you are stuck on</h3>
								<p class="mt-2 text-sm">
									Architecture choices, service tradeoffs, security basics,
									cost concerns, migration stories, or where to begin.
								</p>
							</div>
						</div>
						<div class="grid gap-3 py-6 sm:grid-cols-[8.5rem_1fr]">
							<p class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-primary">
								Share
							</p>
							<div>
								<h3 class="text-base">Turn real work into useful lessons</h3>
								<p class="mt-2 text-sm">
									Short demos, production notes, experiments, failures, and
									fixes are all useful when they help another builder move.
								</p>
							</div>
						</div>
						<div class="grid gap-3 py-6 sm:grid-cols-[8.5rem_1fr]">
							<p class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-primary">
								Meet
							</p>
							<div>
								<h3 class="text-base">Know the builders around Bandung</h3>
								<p class="mt-2 text-sm">
									Connect with people from different teams, campuses,
									startups, agencies, and companies who are learning AWS too.
								</p>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>

					<p class="border-t border-border pt-6 text-sm font-medium text-foreground">
						Open to every experience level. Meetups may be in-person or
						virtual depending on the session.
					</p>
				</div>
			</aside>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
